msgid ""
"Now, which song should I sing today? Any requests? Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Whatever you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Now, which song should I sing today? Any requests? Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Let's go sing!"
msgstr "Andiamo a pescare!"

msgctxt "184"
msgid "...Hold on a second. I just realized I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""
"Ehm... Aspetta un attimo. Mi sono appena reso conto che sono a corto di "
"grana."

msgctxt "196"
msgid "What? Kiryu-san, what do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Oh, okay... Guess that's it, huh? I'm going home. Maybe we can try again "
"another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "(I'd better bring enough cash next time...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Whew... It's really fun to let loose sometimes, you know? And you really "
"helped me get in the mood, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "You chose some great songs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"That was super fun. I hope you'll take me out again. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""
"Mi sono divertita un mondo. Spero che mi porterai fuori di nuovo. "
"<Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Later, Kiryu-san. Stop by the club soon, 'kay?"
msgstr ""

